@ [captured_at] 2026-08-18T20:35:22.8991343-05:00

& [Observed] an unquoted HEAD caret-brace tree revision expression was passed through PowerShell while measuring the campaign tree
  + PowerShell treated the brace expression as shell syntax and the captured value contained multiple unrelated strings
  + Git also emitted an ambiguous-revision diagnostic

& [Impact] is rejected_read_only_diagnostic
  + no repository remote process deployment evidence or authority state changed
  + the malformed value was rejected before it entered an anchor or proof claim

& [Correction] uses git show format percent-T against exact HEAD
  + corrected tree is 3f3237f6d26fa2a7a64434cf8c7b8b55fbd33034
  + git cat-file identifies that object as tree and git fsck succeeds

& [Prevention] avoids caret-brace revision syntax at the PowerShell command boundary
  + use git show format percent-T or pass revision expressions as explicit quoted arguments
  + reject any multi-value digest observation or command containing a Git diagnostic

& [Disposition] is closed_invalid_read_only_diagnostic
